WEBVTT

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:31.039
Ajo hyn ne Skype dhe i zgjidh gjerat.

00:15:31.039 --> 00:15:34.658
I kam pare ta bejne nga nje fshat i quajtur Diggles

00:15:34.658 --> 00:15:36.703
ne veriperendim te Anglise,

00:15:36.703 --> 00:15:40.007
thelle brenda nje fshati ne Tamil Nadu, Indi.

00:15:40.007 --> 00:15:42.247
6,000 milje larg.

00:15:42.247 --> 00:15:45.823
E ben me nje gjest te vetem prej nje-vjecari.

00:15:45.823 --> 00:15:47.538
"Shhh."

00:15:47.538 --> 00:15:50.263
Ne rregull?

00:15:50.263 --> 00:15:51.799
Shiko kete.

00:15:51.799 --> 00:15:56.055
Gjyshja:Nuk mund te me kapesh. Thuaje.

00:15:56.055 --> 00:15:59.823
Nuk mund te me kapesh.

00:15:59.823 --> 00:16:02.791
Femija: Nuk mund te me kapesh.